		/**&nbsp;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
		 * Builds the server overview pages and sets them in the corresponding sections                                                                                                                                                                              
		 * @param{string}sAppkey - Id of the called service.                                                                                                                                                                                                         
		 * @param{string}sAppType - Type of the current application                                                                                                                                                                                                  
